fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"video/video-info-dma-drm.html#gst_video_dma_drm_format_from_gst_format","fragment":"\n\tgst_video_dma_drm_format_from_gst_format\n\n\n\tGstVideo.prototype.video_dma_drm_format_from_gst_format\n\n\n\tGstVideo.video_dma_drm_format_from_gst_format\n\nConverting the video format into dma drm fourcc/modifier pair.\nIf no matching fourcc found, then DRM_FORMAT_INVALID is returned\nand modifier will be set to DRM_FORMAT_MOD_INVALID.\nParameters:\na GstVideoFormat\nreturn location for the modifier\nthe DRM_FORMAT_* corresponding to format.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nConverting the video format into dma drm fourcc/modifier pair.\nIf no matching fourcc found, then DRM_FORMAT_INVALID is returned\nand modifier will be set to DRM_FORMAT_MOD_INVALID.\nParameters:\na GstVideo.VideoFormat\nReturns a tuple made of:\nthe DRM_FORMAT_* corresponding to format.\nthe DRM_FORMAT_* corresponding to format.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nConverting the video format into dma drm fourcc/modifier pair.\nIf no matching fourcc found, then DRM_FORMAT_INVALID is returned\nand modifier will be set to DRM_FORMAT_MOD_INVALID.\nParameters:\na GstVideo.VideoFormat\nReturns a tuple made of:\nthe DRM_FORMAT_* corresponding to format.\nthe DRM_FORMAT_* corresponding to format.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\n"});